          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "I'm pretty proud of the work he's sharing: My deep-dive into how just 16 companies behind 500+ websites are dominating Google's search results. Here's the link if you're curious."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "I've been writing about SEO since I was 16 years old, and now at 33 I've advised some of the biggest brands on the internet like Ahrefs, ConvertKit, Buffer, Kinsta and many more."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Over a single 12 month period alone we've helped our clients acquire millions of extra visitors from Google."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Now we're all-in on sharing our insights to help you with your online journey."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "\"I've hired various SEO experts and Glen was still able to find room for improvement.\""
          },
